abstract: >-
  High-school research demo: in-browser ResNet-18 U-Net lesion segmentation on
  BUSI with external BUS-BRA / BrEaST validation. Served model v1.0.0 INT8 ONNX.
  Not for clinical use. Project by Surabhi Fadnavis. The code, analysis, text,
  and video were produced with AI tools (Cursor).
